[en.DECISION_C03_MUFFIN_ROULETTE_NEW]
Muffin Roulette: §YNew Game§!

[en.DECISION_C03_MUFFIN_ROULETTE_NEW_desc]
Starting a new game will create [?ROOT.VAR_MUFFIN_ROULETTE_CONFIG|Y0] blind boxes on the table, [?ROOT.VAR_MUFFIN_ROULETTE_CONFIG_GOOD|G0] good ones and [?ROOT.VAR_MUFFIN_ROULETTE_CONFIG_BAD|R0] bad ones.

[zh.DECISION_C03_MUFFIN_ROULETTE_NEW]
马芬轮盘赌：§Y新一局§!

[zh.DECISION_C03_MUFFIN_ROULETTE_NEW_desc]
开始新一局的游戏会在桌子上创建[?ROOT.VAR_MUFFIN_ROULETTE_CONFIG|Y0]个盲盒，其中有[?ROOT.VAR_MUFFIN_ROULETTE_CONFIG_GOOD|G0]个好的，[?ROOT.VAR_MUFFIN_ROULETTE_CONFIG_BAD|R0]个坏的。
